 y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>256 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const eventsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; events: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const populationsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read&gt; populations: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const partialsAOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"10\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; partialsA: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">const countPartialsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"12\">@group(0) @binding(3) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; countPartials: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">const ROWS: u32 = 791u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"14\">const LANES: u32 = 256u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">const GROUPS: u32 = 4u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"16\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">fn isFiniteFloat(value: f32) -&gt; bool { return (bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(value) &amp; 0x7f800000u) != 0x7f800000u; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">fn addUint64(left: vec2&lt;u32&gt;, right: vec2&lt;u32&gt;) -&gt; vec2&lt;u32&gt; {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">  let low = left.y + right.y;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">  return vec2&lt;u32&gt;(left.x + right.x + select(0u, 1u, low &lt; left.y), low);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">fn subtractUint64(left: vec2&lt;u32&gt;, right: vec2&lt;u32&gt;) -&gt; vec2&lt;u32&gt; {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">  return vec2&lt;u32&gt;(left.x - right.x - select(0u, 1u, left.y &lt; right.y), left.y - right.y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">fn negateInt64(value: vec2&lt;u32&gt;) -&gt; vec2&lt;u32&gt; {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">  return subtractUint64(vec2&lt;u32&gt;(0u, 0u), value);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">fn compareUint64(left: vec2&lt;u32&gt;, right: vec2&lt;u32&gt;) -&gt; i32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">  if (left.x != right.x) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">    return select(-1i, 1i, left.x &gt; right.x);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">  if (left.y != right.y) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">    return select(-1i, 1i, left.y &gt; right.y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">  return 0i;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">fn isLessUint64(left: vec2&lt;u32&gt;, right: vec2&lt;u32&gt;) -&gt; bool {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">  return left.x &lt; right.x || (left.x == right.x &amp;&amp; left.y &lt; right.y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"49\">fn isLessOrEqualUint64(left: vec2&lt;u32&gt;, right: vec2&lt;u32&gt;) -&gt; bool {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"50\">  return left.x &lt; right.x || (left.x == right.x &amp;&amp; left.y &lt;= right.y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"51\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"52\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"53\">// Signed order: flipping the sign bit of the high words makes them compare as unsigned.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"54\">fn compareInt64(left: vec2&lt;u32&gt;, right: vec2&lt;u32&gt;) -&gt; i32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"55\">  return compareUint64(vec2&lt;u32&gt;(left.x ^ 0x80000000u, left.y), vec2&lt;u32&gt;(right.x ^ 0x80000000u, right.y));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"56\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"57\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"58\">fn shiftLeftUint64(value: vec2&lt;u32&gt;, bits: u32) -&gt; vec2&lt;u32&gt; {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"59\">  if (bits == 0u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"60\">    return value;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"61\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"62\">  if (bits &gt;= 64u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"63\">    return vec2&lt;u32&gt;(0u, 0u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"64\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"65\">  if (bits &gt;= 32u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"66\">    return vec2&lt;u32&gt;(value.y &lt;&lt; (bits - 32u), 0u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"67\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"68\">  return vec2&lt;u32&gt;((value.x &lt;&lt; bits) | (value.y &gt;&gt; (32u - bits)), value.y &lt;&lt; bits);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"69\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"70\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"71\">fn shiftRightUint64(value: vec2&lt;u32&gt;, bits: u32) -&gt; vec2&lt;u32&gt; {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"72\">  if (bits == 0u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"73\">    return value;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"74\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"75\">  if (bits &gt;= 64u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"76\">    return vec2&lt;u32&gt;(0u, 0u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"77\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"78\">  if (bits &gt;= 32u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"79\">    return vec2&lt;u32&gt;(0u, value.x &gt;&gt; (bits - 32u));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"80\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"81\">  return vec2&lt;u32&gt;(value.x &gt;&gt; bits, (value.y &gt;&gt; bits) | (value.x &lt;&lt; (32u - bits)));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"82\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"83\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"84\">// Exact 32 x 32 -&gt; 64 bit product from 16-bit limbs; no partial sum exceeds 2^32.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"85\">fn multiplyUint32Wide(left: u32, right: u32) -&gt; vec2&lt;u32&gt; {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"86\">  let leftLow = left &amp; 0xffffu;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"87\">  let leftHigh = left &gt;&gt; 16u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"88\">  let rightLow = right &amp; 0xffffu;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"89\">  let rightHigh = right &gt;&gt; 16u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"90\">  let lowLow = leftLow * rightLow;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"91\">  let lowHigh = leftLow * rightHigh;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"92\">  let highLow = leftHigh * rightLow;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"93\">  let middle = (lowLow &gt;&gt; 16u) + (lowHigh &amp; 0xffffu) + (highLow &amp; 0xffffu);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"94\">  return vec2&lt;u32&gt;(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"95\">    leftHigh * rightHigh + (lowHigh &gt;&gt; 16u) + (highLow &gt;&gt; 16u) + (middle &gt;&gt; 16u),\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"96\">    (lowLow &amp; 0xffffu) | (middle &lt;&lt; 16u)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"97\">  );\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"98\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"99\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"100\">fn multiplyUint64ByUint32(left: vec2&lt;u32&gt;, right: u32) -&gt; vec2&lt;u32&gt; {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"101\">  let wide = multiplyUint32Wide(left.y, right);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"102\">  return vec2&lt;u32&gt;(wide.x + left.x * right, wide.y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"103\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"104\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"105\">fn multiplyUint64(left: vec2&lt;u32&gt;, right: vec2&lt;u32&gt;) -&gt; vec2&lt;u32&gt; {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"106\">  let wide = multiplyUint32Wide(left.y, right.y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"107\">  return vec2&lt;u32&gt;(wide.x + left.y * right.x + left.x * right.y, wide.y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"108\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"109\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"110\">struct Uint64Division {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"111\">  quotient: vec2&lt;u32&gt;,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"112\">  remainder: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"113\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"114\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"115\">// Restoring division one bit at a time. The running remainder stays below the divisor, so after a\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"116\">// shift it is below 2^33; the bit shifted out of the u32 is carried in overflowBit.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"117\">fn divideUint64ByUint32(value: vec2&lt;u32&gt;, divisor: u32) -&gt; Uint64Division {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"118\">  if (divisor == 0u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"119\">    return Uint64Division(vec2&lt;u32&gt;(0xffffffffu, 0xffffffffu), 0u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"120\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"121\">  var quotient = vec2&lt;u32&gt;(0u, 0u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"122\">  var remainder = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"123\">  for (var bit = 0u; bit &lt; 64u; bit++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"124\">    let position = 63u - bit;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"125\">    let word = select(value.y, value.x, position &gt;= 32u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"126\">    let incoming = (word &gt;&gt; (position &amp; 31u)) &amp; 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"127\">    let overflowBit = remainder &gt;&gt; 31u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"128\">    remainder = (remainder &lt;&lt; 1u) | incoming;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"129\">    if (overflowBit != 0u || remainder &gt;= divisor) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"130\">      remainder = remainder - divisor;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"131\">      if (position &gt;= 32u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"132\">        quotient.x = quotient.x | (1u &lt;&lt; (position - 32u));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"133\">      } else {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"134\">        quotient.y = quotient.y | (1u &lt;&lt; position);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"135\">      }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"136\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"137\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"138\">  return Uint64Division(quotient, remainder);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"139\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"140\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"141\">fn uint64ToFloat(value: vec2&lt;u32&gt;) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><sp